1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,908
In two hundred and thirteen US counties, there is no local news source left.

2
00:00:04,908 --> 00:00:08,828
Nobody reads the county commission agenda for the people who live there.

3
00:00:08,828 --> 00:00:10,390
Townwatch reads it for them.

4
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:13,893
Type a county or a town, anywhere in the US.

5
00:00:13,893 --> 00:00:18,489
This is Edgecombe County, North Carolina, one of those news deserts.

6
00:00:18,489 --> 00:00:26,914
On October fifth, its Board of Commissioners considered a resolution opposing the sale of Rocky Mount's water system to a private entity.

7
00:00:26,914 --> 00:00:31,393
Townwatch found it, explained it in plain English, and said how to take part.

8
00:00:31,393 --> 00:00:36,210
Every sentence links to the agenda item it comes from, down to the page.

9
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:39,466
Click it, and the official document opens right there.

10
00:00:39,466 --> 00:00:44,010
When the record does not give an amount or a time, the page says so.

11
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:45,286
Nothing is guessed.

12
00:00:45,286 --> 00:00:48,528
Near you ranks items by distance from your address.

13
00:00:48,528 --> 00:00:53,385
The address goes from your browser to the Census Bureau, and never to Townwatch.

14
00:00:53,385 --> 00:00:54,752
Here is how it was made.

15
00:00:54,752 --> 00:01:02,656
Tavily found the official agenda pages, and Nemotron Nano checked that each one is official and belongs to the right county.

16
00:01:02,656 --> 00:01:08,567
Nano then sorted all seventy-three items, ten per request, for a third of a cent.

17
00:01:08,567 --> 00:01:15,859
Only nine decisions went to Nemotron Ultra, five hundred and fifty billion parameters, on Nebius Token Factory.

18
00:01:15,859 --> 00:01:19,830
Code checked every sentence against the source before it was published.

19
00:01:19,830 --> 00:01:22,005
The whole county cost eight cents.

20
00:01:22,005 --> 00:01:28,776
Now Porter County, Indiana: a hundred and seventy-five thousand people, and not one local news source.

21
00:01:28,776 --> 00:01:30,546
Nobody has read it here yet.

22
00:01:30,546 --> 00:01:41,718
No setup, no list of websites: Tavily searches, Nano verifies, the agendas are read, every item is sorted, and the decisions that matter are explained.

23
00:01:41,718 --> 00:01:44,388
A few minutes later, the county has a briefing.

24
00:01:44,388 --> 00:01:50,195
A small model looks at everything, the large one only at what matters, and code checks both.

25
00:01:50,195 --> 00:01:58,294
Across three places, Nano sorted a hundred and ninety-one items for one cent; Ultra was ninety-seven percent of the bill.

26
00:01:58,294 --> 00:02:08,528
Every night, a refresh re-reads the places people follow and pays only for new agendas; it ships as a container that runs as a Nebius serverless job.

27
00:02:08,528 --> 00:02:09,479
Townwatch.

28
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:13,111
The agenda, read for the towns that lost their newspaper.

